A NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA
--------------------------
No third-party dataset is redistributed in this repository. Where a study's
code can download one at run time, that code ships and the dataset does not.
In particular, benchmarks/tts-verbalization contains a loader and a config that
reference Apple's PolyNorm-Bench (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0). That dataset is downloaded
by the user at run time if they choose to use it. No PolyNorm row, transcript
or result appears anywhere in this repository.
